[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="ItemDef" format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/world/item_def.gd" id="1_item"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_item")
id = &"lore_roll_of_candles"
display_name = "A Roll of Candles"
spine_colour = Color(0.3, 0.26, 0.16, 1)
text = "[i]Placeholder text: replace or approve.[/i]

An account book. Each line is a name, a niche, and how many candles were paid for. The early pages run to hundreds of candles a season. The hand changes, then changes again, and the lines get shorter.

Toward the end most entries read only [i]one candle, at the shrine[/i], with no name beside them. The last dozen are all in the same careful hand, though the dates cover more years than anyone could have kept them."
